From 6454c33c505de0a6e27fb93b1351d84dea18267d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyson Bruce <tysonstechsolutions@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 18:06:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix: course map tiles, auth performance, and hydration errors

- Switch map tiles from ESRI (returning 503) to Google Satellite with
  fallback options (OSM street map also available)
- Fix messages 406 error by using .maybeSingle() instead of .single()
  for channels with no messages yet
- Add AuthContext provider so all 60+ useAuth() consumers share a single
  auth state instead of each running their own getSession/fetchProfile
- Add suppressHydrationWarning to html/body to fix React error #418
  caused by browser extensions injecting attributes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
